5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I’m a bit nervous, but I’m glad we’re here. I’d like to understand why past programs struggled after the first year.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Midori. We should examine the readmission figures from the call-back trial to see if those earlier efforts actually helped patients.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’m less concerned with patient outcomes right now. I need to see where the workload actually lands. Who else is looking at staffing?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
